reast-font-family:돋움체;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">교육내용</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">수출</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">무역 실무</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">해외 조달시장</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">국제기구</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">해외공공기관</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">진출 실무</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">국내 조달</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">해외마케팅</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">기업 현장방문</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">기업 프로젝트</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">취업 교육 등</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-weight:bold;font-size:3.0pt;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:42.0pt;text-indent:-42.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">   </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">마</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">주요혜택</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 42pt; text-indent: -42pt; font-size: 12pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(1) </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">교육비</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">숙식비</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">교재비 등 </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-weight: bold;\">교육 소요 비용 전액 무료</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">정상 수료 시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(2) </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-weight: bold;\">조달청장 명의 수료증</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">수여 및 </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-weight: bold;\">우수교육생 조달청장 표창 수여</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(3) </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">공공기관</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(koica </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">등</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">), </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">기업 종사자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">교수 등 </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-weight: bold;\">실무 경험이 풍부한 강사진</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">의 강의</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(4) </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">교육과정 내 채용상담회</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">설명회</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">취업 교육 운영하여 </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-weight: bold;\">채용 기회 제공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">등</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:18.1pt;text-indent:-18.1pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">바.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-weight: bold;\">신청기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">2026. 5. 7 ~ 6. 7.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:96.0pt;text-indent:-96.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">사. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">신청방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-fami